{"id":"582399eb5e892787","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-injective-numbering-translation.md","title":"编号翻译可有效改为一一翻译","display":"thm-injective-numbering-translation — 编号翻译可有效改为一一翻译","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-injective-numbering-translation","aliases":["20-thm-injective-numbering-translation"],"display":"thm-injective-numbering-translation — 编号翻译可有效改为一一翻译","chapter":"2","section":"2.3.3","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 2.3.9；Lemma 2.3.11；显式保留逆像 g^{-1}[B]","source_pdf_pages":[72,73],"source_printed_pages":[36,37],"depends_on":["[[20-df-numbering]]","[[20-df-computable]]","[[20-thm-recursion-parameters]]","[[20-thm-smn]]","[[20-df-finite-code]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-injective-numbering-translation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-injective-numbering-translation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-injective-numbering-translation — 编号翻译可有效改为一一翻译"},{"key":"chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"section","html":"2.3.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 2.3.9；Lemma 2.3.11；显式保留逆像 g^{-1}[B]"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72</span><span>73</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>36</span><span>37</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dc642dd12c05d028\" href=\"?note=dc642dd12c05d028\" title=\"20-df-numbering\">20-df-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4f81acfa76416d15\" href=\"?note=4f81acfa76416d15\" title=\"20-thm-recursion-parameters\">20-thm-recursion-parameters</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"59004ac6d23e86f8\" href=\"?note=59004ac6d23e86f8\" title=\"20-df-finite-code\">20-df-finite-code</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi:\\omega\\to\\mathcal C_1\">\\(\\psi:\\omega\\to\\mathcal C_1\\)</span> 为部分可计算函数的序列，不要求联合求值有效；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\">\\(g\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall e\\ \\varphi_e=\\psi_{g(e)}\">\\(\\forall e\\ \\varphi_e=\\psi_{g(e)}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"dc642dd12c05d028\" href=\"?note=dc642dd12c05d028\" title=\"20-df-numbering\">20-df-numbering</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"4f81acfa76416d15\" href=\"?note=4f81acfa76416d15\" title=\"20-thm-recursion-parameters\">20-thm-recursion-parameters</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"59004ac6d23e86f8\" href=\"?note=59004ac6d23e86f8\" title=\"20-df-finite-code\">20-df-finite-code</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}injective-numbering-translation}\\vdash\n\\exists g_1\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\\n[\\forall e\\ \\varphi_e=\\psi_{g_1(e)}\\land\n\\forall e,j\\ (g_1(e)=g_1(j)\\Rightarrow e=j)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}injective-numbering-translation}\\vdash\n\\exists g_1\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\\n[\\forall e\\ \\varphi_e=\\psi_{g_1(e)}\\land\n\\forall e,j\\ (g_1(e)=g_1(j)\\Rightarrow e=j)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>先给恒发散函数的索引类一个有效逃离程序。带参数递归定理给全可计算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m(x)\">\\(m(x)\\)</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_{m(x)}\">\\(\\varphi_{m(x)}\\)</span> 在任意输入上等待 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m(x)\\in W_x\">\\(m(x)\\in W_x\\)</span>，若见到便输出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_x\">\\(W_x\\)</span> 全部是恒发散函数的索引，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m(x)\\in W_x\">\\(m(x)\\in W_x\\)</span> 会同时使其程序全常值和恒发散，矛盾。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m(x)\\notin W_x\">\\(m(x)\\notin W_x\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_{m(x)}\">\\(\\varphi_{m(x)}\\)</span> 恒发散。</p>\n<p>构造全可计算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h(e,k)\">\\(h(e,k)\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_{h(e,k)}=\\varphi_e\">\\(\\varphi_{h(e,k)}=\\varphi_e\\)</span>，且固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 时各 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g(h(e,k))\">\\(g(h(e,k))\\)</span> 不同。取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h(e,0)=e\">\\(h(e,0)=e\\)</span>。已构造到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span>，令有限集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B=\\{g(h(e,i)):i\\le k\\}\">\\(B=\\{g(h(e,i)):i\\le k\\}\\)</span>。参数递归定理给索引 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g(n)\\notin B\">\\(g(n)\\notin B\\)</span>，运行 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e\">\\(\\varphi_e\\)</span>；否则恒发散。这个条件可判定，索引 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 可从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 的有限代码统一获得。</p>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g(n)\\notin B\">\\(g(n)\\notin B\\)</span>，取下一项为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g(n)\\in B\">\\(g(n)\\in B\\)</span>，翻译假设与归纳假设给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_n=\\psi_{g(n)}=\\varphi_e\">\\(\\varphi_n=\\psi_{g(n)}=\\varphi_e\\)</span>，而程序的这一分支恒发散，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e\">\\(\\varphi_e\\)</span> 也是恒发散。此时全可计算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 的逆像 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g^{-1}[B]\">\\(g^{-1}[B]\\)</span> 是可计算的索引集；它的每个成员 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span> 都满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_j=\\psi_{g(j)}=\\varphi_e\">\\(\\varphi_j=\\psi_{g(j)}=\\varphi_e\\)</span>。s-m-n 给其 c.e. 索引 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>，对它应用前段的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m(x)\">\\(m(x)\\)</span>，取下一项 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m(x)\">\\(m(x)\\)</span>。于是新项仍计算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e\">\\(\\varphi_e\\)</span>，且其 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 值不在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>。两种分支都有效，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\">\\(h\\)</span> 全可计算。</p>\n<p>依 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 递归，从无限不同的序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g(h(e,0)),g(h(e,1)),\\ldots\">\\(g(h(e,0)),g(h(e,1)),\\ldots\\)</span> 中选首个大于此前所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g_1(j)\">\\(g_1(j)\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;e\">\\(j&lt;e\\)</span>）的值作为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g_1(e)\">\\(g_1(e)\\)</span>。无限自然数集无界，故每步搜索停止；函数外延及单射性均保持。算法从不求值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\">\\(\\psi\\)</span>，所以不需要其序列有效。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 2.3.9、Lemma 2.3.11；印刷 36–37 / PDF 72–73。逃离步骤必须输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g^{-1}[B]\">\\(g^{-1}[B]\\)</span> 的索引；不能把目标编号中的有限集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 自身当作标准编号的恒发散索引集。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"dc642dd12c05d028","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-recursion-parameters","status":"resolved","id":"4f81acfa76416d15","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-recursion-parameters]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-smn","status":"resolved","id":"8ba6597a854c206f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-smn]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-finite-code","status":"resolved","id":"59004ac6d23e86f8","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-finite-code]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"dc642dd12c05d028","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-df-computable]]；see [[20-thm-recursion-parameters]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]；see [[20-df-finite-code]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location